# Build context for danpearson-edge-functions/Dockerfile.
#
# The edge-function image needs exactly two things out of this repository: the
# canonical function source and the server that dispatches to it. Everything
# else is excluded by default rather than listed as a denial, so a new
# top-level directory cannot silently enter the image, and neither can .env,
# which sits in the repo root, nor backup/, which holds a database dump.

# Exclude everything...
*

# ...then re-include only what the image actually needs.
!supabase/functions
!danpearson-edge-functions/server.ts

# Tests are part of the source tree but have no business in a runtime image.
supabase/functions/**/__tests__
supabase/functions/**/*.test.ts
